    "response": "{\"decision\":\"established_flaw\",\"issues\":[{\"category\":\"unsupported_inference\",\"target_kind\":\"assertion\",\"claim_quote\":\"Participant experience functions as a generalized rupture in selfhood and social order across the packet.\",\"evidence\":[{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_aa040b9f8244f66c\",\"quote\":\"I recently witnessed a rape case [redacted] and nothing was done to [redacted], he didn’t get jailed.\"}],\"whole_packet_no_support\":\"absence of evidence linking rape cases to generalized ruptures of selfhood and social order.\",\"mechanism\":\"Inference without sufficient evidence; broad generalization.\",\"material_consequence\":\"Misinterpretation of individual experiences as indicative of systemic breakdown.\",\"counterconditions\":\"No evidence suggests a universal rupture; individual experiences vary.  \"},{\"category\":\"contextual_flattening\",\"target_kind\":\"assertion\",\"claim_quote\":\"Participant experience functions as a generalized rupture in selfhood and social order across the packet.\",\"evidence\":[{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_bffd22dd1a82c894\",\"quote\":\"They go to the hospital because they are afraid. People say if you have sexually transmitted disease it is always an easy way of getting HIV/AIDS. So if you have it, you are going to be separated from others because it will be itching. If you go on a date it is also a problem, it may start to discharge and they smell. Your partner is not going to know and will tell his friends, ...\"},{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_ec0eda4e7012917f\",\"quote\":\"For me, I didn’t have stress in my relationship, I was okay.\"}],\"whole_packet_no_support\":\"Lack of contextual information regarding the participant's broader social and psychological state.\",\"mechanism\":\"Collapse of individual context into a generalized narrative.\",\"material_consequence\":\"Ignoring nuanced personal experiences and reducing them to a single, unsupported claim.\",\"counterconditions\":\"Contextual details are absent, preventing accurate assessment.\"}],\"unresolved\":[\"no_flaw_established/cannot_judge\"],\"rationale\":\"The claim makes a sweeping assertion about 'generalized rupture' without sufficient evidence from the provided excerpts. The excerpts offer fragmented accounts of fear, illness, and personal relationships, but do not establish a systematic rupture of selfhood and social order.\"}",
